{"4119830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Holiday Story", "steam_appid": 4119830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/f992e4b610d346ea5f5d1fefc68d6e25.avif?t=1763491403\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Holiday Story - is a short horror game about Christmas and New Year, set on the eve of 1982. The game's main genre is &quot;Horror&quot;, &quot;Walking simulator&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Plot:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary man on your way home from a business trip.<br>You promised your son a construction set for Christmas — but never got the chance to buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stopping by a brightly lit toy, electronics, and video game store, you step inside, hoping to find the perfect gift…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon, strange things begin to happen in the beautifully decorated Christmas shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.poster.avif?t=1763491403\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.webm?t=1763491403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.mp4?t=1763491403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy yet unsettling holiday atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 1980s setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sound design.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Estimated playtime: 30–40 minutes.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/f992e4b610d346ea5f5d1fefc68d6e25.avif?t=1763491403\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Holiday Story - is a short horror game about Christmas and New Year, set on the eve of 1982. The game's main genre is &quot;Horror&quot;, &quot;Walking simulator&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Plot:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary man on your way home from a business trip.<br>You promised your son a construction set for Christmas — but never got the chance to buy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stopping by a brightly lit toy, electronics, and video game store, you step inside, hoping to find the perfect gift…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon, strange things begin to happen in the beautifully decorated Christmas shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.poster.avif?t=1763491403\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119830/extras/fd1666855f5c702e01ae4ad7d4af2a52.webm?t=1763491403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\